# Role/topic routing for the granular rule files at the reactor root.
#
# One role, matched by classes in THREE different modules (core, engine, cli). All three
# resolve the same output path — .kiro/steering/reactor-spine.md, .trae/rules/reactor-spine.md
# and the rest — so this is the layout of issue #365, where each module's compile replaced the
# file with only its own classes and the siblings' guardrails vanished. CI asserts all three
# survive; showcase/ keeps its per-class files, so both paths stay covered.
reactor-spine = **/multimodule/**
